OL,3,GNEWSARenewed hope for wildlife after
OL,4,Acharity success
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has secured land to build a
OL,7,Fnew wildlife hospital after a six-year
OL,8,F"fight" to make their plans a reality.
OL,10,FOxfordshire Wildlife Rescue (OWR) has
OL,11,Fraised #100,000 to help fund the
OL,12,Fproject after an appeal to build a
OL,13,Fdedicated centre to better treat sick,
OL,14,Finjured and orphaned wild animals.
OL,16,FIt plans to include specialist wards
OL,17,Ffor hedgehogs, small mammals and birds,
OL,18,Fas well as a nursery for small animals.
OL,20,FThere is no set opening date, but the
OL,21,Fcharity aims to begin work at the new
OL,22,Fsite by May 2027.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
